# AVAREN Design System

Every new component must reuse existing design tokens from `src/styles.css`. Do not introduce ad-hoc colors, radii, or spacing.

## Tokens (CSS variables)

| Token | Role |
|-------|------|
| `--black`, `--obsidian`, `--graphite`, `--steel` | Surface hierarchy |
| `--cream`, `--muted` | Primary and secondary text |
| `--gold`, `--gold-bright` | Primary actions, emphasis, achievement |
| `--green` | Recovery, readiness, completion |
| `--danger` | Warnings, destructive actions |
| `--line` | Borders and dividers |
| `--radius` | Card and panel corners (24px) |
| `--shadow` | Elevated surfaces |

## Typography

- **DM Sans** — body and UI text
- **Manrope** — headings, brand, strong emphasis
- **Eyebrow** — `.eyebrow` class for section labels (gold, tracked caps)

## Component families

Reuse existing patterns before creating new ones:

- `.hero-card` — primary daily focus
- `.luxury-panel`, `.menu-card` — secondary content blocks
- `.gold-button` — primary action
- `.empty-state` — empty/error states
- `.section-heading` — eyebrow + title + optional subtitle

## Rules

- **Generous spacing** — calm layouts; never pack controls tight.
- **One primary action** per screen — one gold button, visually dominant.
- **Bright-gym readable** — cream on dark surfaces; minimum 17px body on mobile.
- **Consistency over novelty** — match existing card, button, and panel patterns.
- **Mobile-first** — design for 320px+; max content width ~760px.

Full reference: `docs/AVAREN_OS/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.
